%% Nerv End-to-End Event Flow
%%
%% CLI event travels through adapter, envelope, dispatch,
%% pattern matching, handler fork, decision merge, and reply.

flowchart LR
    CLI[CLI Event] --> Adapter[CLI Adapter]
    Adapter --> Envelope[Build Envelope]
    Envelope --> Redact[Redaction]
    Redact --> Dispatch[Dispatch]
    Dispatch --> Match{Pattern Match}
    Match -->|no match| Allow[Default Allow]
    Match -->|matched| Fork[Fork Handler 1..N]
    Fork --> H1[Handler 1]
    Fork --> H2[Handler 2]
    Fork --> HN[Handler N]
    H1 --> Merge[Decision Merge]
    H2 --> Merge
    HN --> Merge
    Merge --> Reply[Reply Envelope]
    Allow --> Reply
    Reply --> Adapter
    Adapter --> CLI2[CLI Response]
